Forward 1: Two natives go left→right. Say natives 1 and 2.
Left = {3, ..., N}, Right = {1, 2}
Edge: (1,2)

Forward 2: Two natives go left→right. Say natives 1 and 3.
Left = {4, ..., N}, Right = {1, 2, 3}
Edge: (1,3)

Forward 3: Two natives go left→right. Say natives 1 and 4.
Left = {5, ..., N}, Right = {1, 2, 3, 4}
Edge: (1,4)

Strategy:
- Forward 1: Natives 1, 2 go right. (Edge 1-2). Right: {1,2}, Left: {3,4}
- Return 1: Native 1 goes left. Right: {2}, Left: {1,3,4}
- Forward 2: Natives 1, 3 go right. (Edge 1-3). Right: {1,2,3}, Left: {4}
- Return 2: Native 1 goes left. Right: {2,3}, Left: {1,4}
- Forward 3: Natives 1, 4 go right. (Edge 1-4). Right: {1,2,3,4}, Left: {}

